6. Flasher and distribution tooling
------------------------------------

The Windows flasher embeds Bouffalo Lab BLFlashCommand and loader support files
from the pinned SDK revision. It can download the WCH CH340/CH341 driver from
WCH's official site after verifying the expected SHA-256 and Authenticode
publisher; that driver is not stored in this source repository.

The flasher's Rust dependencies and exact versions are listed in:

  tools/ds5dongle-flasher/Cargo.toml
  tools/ds5dongle-flasher/Cargo.lock

Each dependency remains subject to the copyright and license metadata in its
own source distribution. Release redistributors should generate and ship the
appropriate dependency notices for the binary/package they distribute.

